 = 
 + Return | open terminal (kitty)
 + SHIFT + Return | open floating terminal (kitty)
 + Q | kill active window
 + D | launch app menu (rofi)
 + W | change wallpaper (Wallpaper.sh)
 + T | change theme
 + SHIFT + W | select wallpaper (WallpaperSelect.sh)
 + ALT + E | switch wallpaper engine (awww/hyprpaper)
 + E | open file manager (Nautilus)
 + SHIFT + E | open terminal file manager (Yazi)
 + V | toggle floating window
 + ALT + V | toggle all windows to float
 + F | toggle fullscreen
 + ALT + D | switch Rofi theme
 + ALT + C | clipboard manager
 + ALT + W | wipe clipboard history
 + SHIFT + D | open emoji picker
 + SHIFT + P | toggle pseudo-tiling
 + X | open power menu
 + ALT + X | switch power menu theme
 + C | open VS Code
 + B | open browser (Default)
ALT + B | reset default browser
CTRL + ESCAPE | reload Waybar
CTRL + ALT + ESCAPE | toggle Waybar visibility
 + SHIFT + L | lockscreen (hyprlock)
 + ALT + L | lockscreen theme (hyprlock)
 + CTRL + W | switch Waybar layout
 + CTRL + E | edit dotfiles
 + CTRL + R | reload Hyprland
CTRL + U | system update
 + CTRL + U | updated hyprconf
PRINT | screenshot menu
 + SHIFT + S | area screenshot (snip)
 + ALT + S | screenshot & annotate (Satty)
 + SHIFT + H | show keybind help
 + SHIFT + M | exit Hyprland
 + N | toggle special minimized (pyprland)
 + SHIFT + N | toggle minimized (pyprland)
 + SHIFT + O | shift monitor (pyprland)
 + SHIFT + R | run startup script
 + SHIFT + Z | ++ zoom
 + Z | zoom
 + S | open settings in terminal
 + TAB | switch windows with Rofi
ALT + TAB | Cycle through Windows
FN / F2 | open mail.google.com
FN / F3 | open Brave (Private)
FN / F5 | open Spotify
FN / F6 | previous song
FN / F7 | play / pause song
FN / F8 | next song
 + \ | toggle home screen widgets
FN / F9 | toggle audio mute
FN / F10 | decrease volume
FN / F11 | increase volume
 + J | move focus down
 + K | move focus up
 + L | move focus right
 + H | move focus left
 + CTRL + J | move window down
 + CTRL + K | move window up
 + CTRL + L | move window right
 + CTRL + H | move window left
 + 1-0 | switch workspace 1-10
 + SHIFT + 1-0 | move window to workspace 1-10
 + ALT + 1-0 | move window silently to workspace 1-10
 + mouse scroll | cycle workspaces
 + left click | move window
 + right click | resize window
